device_id,device_ip,vlan,svi_ip,svi_mask,guest_ip,model
# One row per device — NETWORK INFO ONLY. Tokens and secrets are handled
# automatically by tools/gen-device-installers.sh (it talks to the running IRIS server).
# 'model' is OPTIONAL and LAST. Leave it blank to let Console onboarding
# auto-detect the platform (Guest Shell / IOx) from a live 'show version';
# set it (e.g. C9300-48UXM, IE-3400) to pick the installer deterministically.
# SDA deployment (IS-IS underlay) is assumed. svi_ip/guest_ip are a /30 at the
# back end of the device's subnet.
